    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>The smallest quantity of impurities in concrete can seriously diminish the strength and longevity of concrete works.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following concrete testing services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
